WEBVTT

00:34:59.850 --> 00:35:01.016
What is that?

00:35:01.040 --> 00:35:03.934
We're not even almost talking about that.

00:35:03.958 --> 00:35:05.425
When I was growing up --

00:35:05.879 --> 00:35:10.609
So again, I was born 1949,

00:35:10.633 --> 00:35:12.990
right after the new
world order was created.

00:35:13.014 --> 00:35:15.537
New world order was created 1945.

00:35:16.522 --> 00:35:17.929
In 1945.

00:35:17.953 --> 00:35:20.553
And that was when there was
the breakdown of the system

00:35:20.577 --> 00:35:22.252
and then we had a new world order.

00:35:22.276 --> 00:35:23.633
We didn't have as much debt,

00:35:23.657 --> 00:35:25.029
we came back [from] the war,

00:35:25.053 --> 00:35:29.124
and there was an environment
of equal opportunity.